WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.340
Meet Ana's family. What do they do?

2
00:00:04.790 --> 00:00:09.248
Hi! I'm Ana. I'm twenty-five years old, and I'm an accountant.

3
00:00:09.698 --> 00:00:11.509
I work in an office in Rio.

4
00:00:13.759 --> 00:00:16.639
This is my father, Paulo. He's a doctor.

5
00:00:17.089 --> 00:00:19.968
He works at a big hospital, and he wears a white coat.

6
00:00:22.218 --> 00:00:24.911
This is my mother, Rosa. She's a teacher.

7
00:00:25.361 --> 00:00:29.959
She teaches children at a school near our house. She goes to work by bus.

8
00:00:32.209 --> 00:00:34.949
This is my sister, Bia. She's a pilot.

9
00:00:35.399 --> 00:00:37.303
She flies to Europe every week!

10
00:00:39.553 --> 00:00:42.897
And this is my brother, Leo. He's a musician.

11
00:00:43.347 --> 00:00:46.365
He plays the guitar, and he sings in a band at night.

12
00:00:48.615 --> 00:00:50.566
And you? What do you do?

